WEBVTT

00:00:04.676 --> 00:00:11.416
Marmalade Boy

00:00:11.416 --> 00:00:14.442
But it's still on my mind

00:00:14.553 --> 00:00:16.521
This morning,
more so than before...

00:00:17.923 --> 00:00:21.154
A dream was interrupted

00:00:21.293 --> 00:00:24.785
I want to know how it ends for...
him and me

00:00:31.136 --> 00:00:36.438
Ah, God, please stop time

00:00:36.942 --> 00:00:40.036
Can't ﬁnd my books...
school uniform...

00:00:40.178 --> 00:00:43.011
My hair won't dry yet

00:00:44.349 --> 00:00:49.810
Ah, help me...my ribbon
doesn't seem to go on right

00:00:50.455 --> 00:00:56.587
All because I dreamt of him

00:00:57.496 --> 00:01:01.296
When I bit into my
half—burnt piece of toast...

00:01:04.036 --> 00:01:08.837
All of a sudden
my heart started pounding

00:01:10.642 --> 00:01:15.545
Sweet and bitter marmalade

00:01:15.681 --> 00:01:18.115
That's why it's on my mind

00:01:18.650 --> 00:01:20.675
Why am I feeling this way?

00:01:22.154 --> 00:01:23.917
Alll want is

00:01:25.390 --> 00:01:28.882
to see his smile

00:02:24.549 --> 00:02:32.251
MISSING EACH OTHER —
"I'M SO LONELY,
I CAN'T TAKE IT ANYMORE."

00:08:38.189 --> 00:08:40.020
IMPERFECT REFLECTIONS
IN THE MIRROR
MEIKO AKIZUKI

00:11:07.005 --> 00:11:08.472
MARMALADE BOY

00:11:15.747 --> 00:11:18.375
MARMALADE BOY

00:15:17.288 --> 00:15:19.552
MIND YOUR OWN BUSINESS

00:22:11.535 --> 00:22:12.365
MARMALADE BOY

00:22:34.558 --> 00:22:37.493
LOVE CONFESSION —
"I WANT YOU
TO SEE ME AS A MAN!"

00:22:52.076 --> 00:22:56.570
I found the light

00:22:56.714 --> 00:23:01.947
That cleansed my heart

00:23:02.086 --> 00:23:06.682
In the awakening sky

00:23:06.824 --> 00:23:12.285
You shine

00:23:12.429 --> 00:23:17.366
Andl know

00:23:17.534 --> 00:23:22.471
No matter how far
apart we may be

00:23:22.606 --> 00:23:27.509
We're greeting
the same dawn

00:23:27.645 --> 00:23:32.981
Aren't we?

00:23:33.117 --> 00:23:37.747
It's the brightly
glittering thread

00:23:37.888 --> 00:23:43.190
That binds our memories

00:23:43.327 --> 00:23:48.390
In the future beyond futures

00:23:48.565 --> 00:23:53.559
The gods will be there for us

00:23:53.704 --> 00:23:59.973
The gods will be there for us
